From b656397b93196396ac146c4a10f9c2fd3b878571 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qrt <qrt@localhost>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 20:57:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UI/QRT: sized for the screen: a scaled toolbar, pages at the
 panel's pixel ratio, flick scrolling

The shell passes its density (--qrt-scale=<percent>). The toolbar is 1.25x the
shell's controls, pages are laid out at a device pixel ratio of 1.5 on the
Venue's 8" panel, a finger drag moves the page by CSS pixels so it follows the
finger, and a flick keeps the page moving and slowing down.
---
